<!-- ============ WHAT DO WE DO ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 20px;">TeamworkCares is dedicated to advancing the mission of global equality through carefully crafted initiatives. An initiative serves as a proactive avenue for effecting positive change, particularly aimed at enhancing situations. These initiatives can encompass internal initiatives aimed at fostering an inclusive company culture, direct community engagement, or collaborative efforts through partnerships.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">Leveraging our expansive global network and diverse team, TeamworkCares is committed to championing initiatives that strive to make a meaningful impact in our communities, raise awareness, and advocate for equality. Since its establishment, our members have actively contributed to positive transformations in communities worldwide.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STRATEGIC INITIATIVES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="initiatives">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Strategic Initiatives</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Education, mentorship and community.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="init-grid">
      <div class="init-card">
        <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/initiative-education.webp" alt="Students supported by a TeamworkCares education initiative" loading="lazy">
        <div class="init-body">
          <h3>Education</h3>
          <p>Provide youth with mentorship and education; inspire learning, new ideas and help develop sustainable skills, and provide a social support network relevant to the student's immediate education needs and life skills. Mentoring is both remote and face-to-face over a sustained period (the school year) to promote greater knowledge, wisdom, or experience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="init-card">
        <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/initiative-mentorship.webp" alt="A TeamworkCares mentorship session" loading="lazy">
        <div class="init-body">
          <h3>Mentorship</h3>
          <p>Partners with community organizations to support and develop diverse and underserved youth and adult entrepreneurs. This group aims to develop opportunities for TeamworkCares members to share their knowledge, support, and guidance in various areas of experience, based on the entrepreneur's needs, to help promote growth and opportunity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="init-card">
        <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/initiative-community.webp" alt="TeamworkCares volunteers at a local community event" loading="lazy">
        <div class="init-body">
          <h3>Community</h3>
          <p>Dedicated to discovering different activities and events within Teamwork's local communities which promote or support the initiatives and values of TeamworkCares. Focused on organizing all logistics necessary so Teamwork staff can participate easily and promote in order to further raise awareness of systemic racism and support equality.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHAT DO WE BELIEVE IN ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">What We Believe In</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What do we believe in?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-grid">
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-target-arrow"></i></div>
        <h3>Mission</h3>
        <p>To raise awareness on the challenges of systemic racism and supporting equality around the world. Teamwork employees use their collective skills, knowledge, and ideas to bring about a positive and impactful change through education, mentorship and community initiatives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-eye"></i></div>
        <h3>Vision</h3>
        <p>To support Black Lives Matter, local organizations, underserved communities and educational initiatives. Through these actions TeamworkCares will empower social change, drive positive community growth and take a stand against social injustice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-scale"></i></div>
        <h3>Values</h3>
        <p>TeamworkCares is driven by respect, acceptance, and accountability. We stand up for justice and equality across the world. We are committed to driving out discrimination where we find it, supporting change through our resources, and advocating for meaningful action.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FEATURED EVENT ============ -->
<section class="tm-band">
  <div class="tm-band-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Featured Event</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ukraine Awareness Month: TeamworkCares sponsors AFUMED.</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <img src="/assets/images/company/cares/afumed.webp" alt="A collage from the TeamworkCares AFUMED sponsorship in Ukraine" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); display: block;">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">AFUMED is a charitable organization committed to providing essential medical support to Ukrainian soldiers on the front lines. Since 2022, they have supplied 160 first-aid kits and supported 53 military units. Their specialized ambulatory first-aid kits and organized roll packs, developed with military doctors, ensure quick access to vital medications. AFUMED emphasizes financial transparency and replenishes these kits upon request, making a life-saving difference. The organization relies on public support to empower and protect heroes with the necessary medical supplies.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

